WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.173
Good morning! I want to make an omelet for breakfast. Let's look in the fridge!

2
00:00:07.623 --> 00:00:10.502
Hmm… There aren't any tomatoes.

3
00:00:10.952 --> 00:00:14.714
And there isn't any cheese. Oh, no!

4
00:00:16.964 --> 00:00:19.843
But there are some eggs. Good!

5
00:00:20.293 --> 00:00:22.661
I need some eggs for the omelet.

6
00:00:24.911 --> 00:00:29.695
And there are some oranges. I can make some orange juice!

7
00:00:30.145 --> 00:00:35.021
Juice is uncountable, so I say: some juice.

8
00:00:37.271 --> 00:00:41.450
No tomatoes, no cheese… no omelet today!

9
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:46.359
So, I have a fried egg and some juice for breakfast.

10
00:00:48.609 --> 00:00:53.113
Oh, and there are some apples, too. Perfect for dessert!

11
00:00:53.563 --> 00:00:56.536
And you? Is there any milk in your fridge?

